\">Might Rings</a> when facing these creatures, their <a href=\"#/wiki/Critical%20Hit\">Critical Hits</a> can be brutal and kill even high level mages in one shot. Shooters should never stand still blocking them and must be moving all the time during the boss fights to avoid their damage.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Undead_Humanoids\">Undead Humanoids</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Abominable%20Servant\">Abominable Servant</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Ugly%20Monster\">Ancient Ugly Monster</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Mummy\">Animated Mummy</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bad%20Thought\">Bad Thought</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Banshee\">Banshee</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blight%20Mariner\">Blight Mariner</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blightwalker\">Blightwalker</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Boogey\">Boogey</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brain%20Head\">Brain Head</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Channeling%20Earl%20Osam\">Channeling Earl Osam</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Count%20Vlarkorth\">Count Vlarkorth</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Shambler\">Crypt Shambler</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cursed%20Gladiator\">Cursed Gladiator</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Priest\">Death Priest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Reaper\">Death Reaper</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid%27s%20Apparition\">Druid's Apparition</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Duke%20Krule\">Duke Krule</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Duskbringer\">Duskbringer</a></li><li><a h